# Deployment Template Is the Source of Truth

`deployments/deployment.yaml` is generated. Do not edit it directly.

Edit `deployments/build/deployment.template.yaml` (and `deployments/build/env-variables.yaml` for env vars), then regenerate:

```bash
make deployment-generate
```

CI runs this and checks `git diff --exit-code deployments/deployment.yaml`. Direct edits to `deployment.yaml` will be overwritten and cause CI failure.
